  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6a11b02d30ae9104d8c7f33e6f6be9cd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ProfessorNPC
  boxSprite: {fileID: 417682235, guid: 4d224b39b7ce454498d3e59709b76128, type: 3}
  dialogueLinesEs:
  - "TEKNIKAL MAY CRY \u2014 TERMINAL DEL PROYECTO"
  - "Bienvenido a TMC: un proyecto estudiantil que une videojuegos, programaci\xF3n
    y electr\xF3nica."
  - "Desarrollado en Unity y C#, integra un joystick hecho con Arduino y comunicaci\xF3n
    serial."
  - El hardware real se vuelve parte de la experiencia de juego.
  - "Desarrollado para ExpoT\xE9cnica. \xA1Gracias por visitar!"
  dialogueLinesEn:
  - "TEKNIKAL MAY CRY \u2014 PROJECT TERMINAL"
  - Welcome to TMC, a student project combining videogames, programming and electronics.
  - Built in Unity and C#, it uses an Arduino joystick and serial communication.
  - Real hardware becomes part of the game experience.
  - "Made for ExpoT\xE9cnica. Thanks for visiting!"
  optionsEs: []
  optionsEn: []
  escenaASi: 
  dialogueMark: {fileID: 209313239}
  completionKey: 
  completedLinesEs: []
  completedLinesEn: []
  completedOptionsEs: []
  completedOptionsEn: []
